# Declared exceptions to template-audit.sh, with reasons. Printed on every run.
profile-page: This repository is the GitHub profile page for the account `sevamrk`. GitHub renders README.md from a repository named exactly after the account, and that README is the only file here by design. Every code-repository check fails on it for the same reason: there is no licence to grant on a page about a person, no dependency manifest, no tests, and the owner's own name in the one file is the entire point of the page rather than leftover state. Declared 2026-08-29. ⛔ The exemption applies only while this repo carries no source file; template-audit.sh fails hard if a .py, .ts or .sh ever appears beside this waiver.
